## Case: rounds-first
id: "py.float-args.1129.rounds-first"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1129"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.as"
syntax: "auto-script"

```auto
use.py struct: pack

fn main() int {
    var third = 1.0f / 3.0f
    var triple = third * 3.0f
    print(pack(">f", triple * 3.0f).hex().to(str))
    var dthird = 0.1d / 3.0d
    print(pack(">d", dthird * 3.0d).hex().to(str))
    var total = 0.1f
    var i = 0
    for i < 9 {
        total = total + 0.1f
        i = i + 1
    }
    print(pack(">f", total).hex().to(str))
    return 0
}
```

