## Case: sqrt-runtime-negative
id: "py.float-args.1129.sqrt-runtime-negative"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1129"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.as"
syntax: "auto-script"

```auto
use.py math: sqrt

fn negate(v float) float {
    return -v
}

fn main() int {
    var seed = 4.0f
    var value = negate(seed)
    var caught = 0
    try {
        var root = sqrt(value)
        print(root.to(float))
    } catch e {
        caught = caught + 1
        print(e.to(str))
    }
    print(caught)
    print(sqrt(9.0f).to(float))
    return 0
}
```

